##### Package Information

PackageName: example-embedded-project-samv71
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-example-embedded-project-samv71
PackageVersion: 1.0.0
PackageSupplier: Organization: Example Project Team
PackageDownloadLocation: https://github.com/smerschel/example
PackageHomePage: https://github.com/smerschel/example
PackageSummary: Embedded systems project implementing command and telemetry system for SAM V71 microcontroller
PackageDescription: This project implements a command and telemetry system for SAM V71 microcontrollers. It includes a circular buffer implementation, command manager, protocol handling, and system time management. Features include thread-safe circular buffer operations, command handling system, protocol implementation for packet handling, system time management, telemetry management, and comprehensive unit tests with coverage reporting. Cross-compiled for ARM Cortex-M7 architecture.
PackageFileName: example-embedded-project-samv71-1.0.0.tar.gz
PackageVerificationCode: 4e3211c67a2d28fced849ee1bb76e7391b93f125 (excludes: ./SPDXRef-File-example-project.spdx)
